+// preferRoom (env WWFC_PREFER_ROOM=1, local patch): when a matchmaking search matches
+// several open hosts, answer with only the host whose room already has the most members
+// (sessions in a room carry "+joinindex"; the host has one "+conn_<i>" key per member).
+// Lone hosts are only offered when no room is open. Without it, the list comes out of a
+// Go map in random order, and searchers that pick different hosts split the party.
+var preferRoom = os.Getenv("WWFC_PREFER_ROOM") == "1"
